      "message": "Merge origin/main into issue/108-probe-ops\n\nResolve 21 conflicts keeping both sides: the probe touches\n(Toolpath.probes, TOUCH / RETREAT / FOUND records, Dump.probe_result)\nalongside main's threading records (Toolpath.threads, THREAD records),\nwear compensation (Comp.wear), coolant (Dump.coolant) and the\nToolpathCache::new / path_sig cache.\n\n- cl: both fields on Toolpath; world_path re-points each probe touch\n  through the local-to-world move map (a flattened arc becomes several\n  chords) and maps its target, instead of cloning local indices.\n- post: both record families; the dump checks touches and brackets\n  threads; the engine keeps the by-name probing refusals.\n- app: ahead.rs keeps \"a probe cuts nothing\" on main's path_sig read;\n  the PathDto loads probes through ToolpathCache::new; ProbeTouchDto\n  moves to project/touch_dto.rs (entity.rs size).\n- motion/sim/tests: struct literals carry threads and probes.\n- RECOMMENDED.md taken from main; this PR's entries move unchanged to\n  docs/decisions/108-probe.md (PR #250 rule).\n\nRefs #108\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
